WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.781
Lab 2 runs the same read in
a Microsoft 365 test tenant,

2
00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:08.975
in the worldwide or G C C
cloud, never production.

3
00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:12.500
Sign in as a test administrator
who holds an admin role.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.509
Learn doesn't name which admin roles
Graph accepts for a delegated read,

5
00:00:16.509 --> 00:00:19.838
so the Message center reader
roles are the narrowest to try.

6
00:00:19.838 --> 00:00:23.189
Sign in delegated, with
only the two read scopes;

7
00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.025
an administrator consents to them once.

8
00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:29.233
Cross-check Learn's own cmdlet
against the kit's collection,

9
00:00:29.233 --> 00:00:31.262
and look at the posts that need action.

10
00:00:31.262 --> 00:00:33.014
Then record one open item:

11
00:00:33.014 --> 00:00:37.187
the tags you see on retirement
posts, which Learn doesn't list.

12
00:00:37.187 --> 00:00:41.126
To back it out, sign out, delete
the run, and remove the consent in

13
00:00:41.126 --> 00:00:45.450
the Microsoft Entra admin center if
it was granted only for this lab.

14
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.600
The authors haven't run Lab 2.

15
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.710
The workbook's Chapter 2
has the exact commands.
